      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/Blessings",
          "kind": "wiki",
          "read": "2026-11-18",
          "note": "Price formulas by level: regular blessing 2000 up to level 30, 200 x (level - 20) from 31 to 119, 20000 + 75 x (level - 120) from 120; enhanced 2600, 260 x (level - 20), 26000 + 100 x (level - 120); Twist of Fate 2000, 200 x (level - 20) up to level 269, 50000 from level 270. Blessing of the Inquisition works as the 5 regular blessings and costs 10% more than buying them separately. Level 75: 55,000 for the 5 regular blessings."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://tibia.fandom.com/wiki/Character_Stats_Calculator",
          "kind": "calculator",
          "read": "2026-11-18",
          "note": "TibiaWiki's separate interactive calculator (not the rule page; research/sources/tibiawiki-character-stats-calculator.txt): one regular blessing, one enhanced blessing, 'All 7 Blessings' and 'All 7 Blessings (using Henricus)' (the Inquisition blessing instead of the 5 regular ones) for levels 8, 30, 31, 75, 119, 120, 121, 269, 270, 271, 1000 and 2000. It does not show the Inquisition price by itself (Henricus total minus the two enhanced blessings gives it; at levels 121, 269 and 271 that is the price rounded down, 110,412.5 -> 110,412) and has no Twist of Fate."
        },
        {
          "url": "https://tibiapal.com/bless",
          "kind": "calculator",
          "read": "2026-11-18",
          "note": "Capture research/calc-tests/blessings-tibiapal.json: cost of the 5 regular blessings (with and without Henricus), 2 enhanced blessings and Twist of Fate, shown in thousands of gold (rounded by the page) for levels 30 to 2000; used only where our exact value is a whole number of thousands. It shows negative prices below level 30, so level 8 is not covered.",
          "label": "calc.how.label.blessingsTibiapal"
        }
